Authority boundaries
- apm: external project dependency manifest, lock, resolution, deployment, and audit
  authority: external dependency state; 0.31.0
- gh-skill: GitHub search, preview, source provenance, and publication
  authority: discovery only in this workflow; gh version 2.97.0
- asm: cross-provider catalog search and inspection
  authority: discovery only in this workflow; npx package pinned to 2.14.0
- vercel-skills: skills.sh and .well-known discovery
  authority: discovery only in this workflow; npx package pinned to 1.5.22
- workshop: source-agnostic recall, use evidence, ratings, evaluations, and contributions
  authority: cross-project memory only; 0.1.0
- node: runtime for pinned discovery CLIs
  authority: runtime; v22.23.2

Discovery tools never install into native or APM-managed project paths.
Every delegated command is printed before it runs.
